'''Trash Cat''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that can be unlocked from the [[Catnip Challenges]] after beating [[Sender Unknown|Mystery Package]] during the 88.88M Downloads Worldwide Event. This unit was the winner of the [[The Battle Cats|English]] and Taiwanese Versions' [[PONOS Campaigns/The OutCats|The OutCats]] campaigns, voted for by fans. It was added in [[Version 13.3 Update|Version 13.3]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 740
|rarity = EX
|name1 = Trash Cat
|name2 = Mimic Cat
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Mimic Cat''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Trash Cat is a specialized midranger that deals Massive Damage to Zombies and can hit their corpses thanks to its Soulstrike ability. Trash Cat has strong supplementary DPS and can even outrange or counter notable enemies such as [[Lord Gravey]], [[Miss Haka]], [[Zyclone]], and [[Johnnyleon]]. One of its downsides is that it has rather subpar health and if a Zombie were to burrow or revive where Trash Cat is currently residing, Trash Cat is nearly guaranteed to die. Another weakness is its long attack animation which can lead to missed hits or make it vulnerable to any oncoming enemies that can strike it. It's important to keep Trash Cat alive with meatshields so that it may have the ability to stack and easily hit zombies from a distance.

As soon as you unlock [[Ancient Egg: N107 (Rare Cat)|Cat Chief]], [[Teacher BearCat (Rare Cat)|Cadaver BearCat]] or [[Talents|Talented]] [[Archer Cat (Rare Cat)|Cataur]], Trash Cat becomes outclassed, but can still be used in select stages such as [[The Haunted 1LDK]].

