==Trivia==
*Trash Cat's evolution may be based on the saying "One man's trash is another man's treasure."
*Mimic Cat is a reference to the [[wikipedia:Mimic (Dungeons & Dragons)|Mimic]], a treasure chest-mimicking monster from ''[[wikipedia:Dungeons & Dragons|Dungeons & Dragons]]''.
*Prior to [[Version 13.4 Update|Version 13.4]], there was an error in Mimic Cat's description stating that it had "Tough vs [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombies]]", when in reality it lacks that ability.
*Mimic Cat's treasure chest heavily resembles the [[Battle Items#Treasure Radar|Treasure Radar]].
*Trash Cat loosely resembles a finalist from the [[PONOS Campaigns/YourBattleCat Design Contest|#YourBattleCat Design Contest]].

